he third quarter of the previous financial year and The figures upto the end of the third quarter had only been reviewed and not subject to audit.           8 The figures for the previous period/ year have been re-arranged wherever necessary to conform to the current period's / year's classification.          9 The said Financials results are also available on the website of stock exchange www.bseindia.com and www.nseindia.com and on the company's website www.apollo-micro.com under section Investors''.                        For and on behalf of the Board of Directors of Apollo Micro Systems Limited                                Karunakar Reddy Baddam        Managing Director        DIN: 00790139               Place: Hyderabad        Date: 10 August 2023</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
